{"language":"FCL-1","records":[{"id":"n1","type":"claim","text":"Cheaply written agreements are incomplete contracts in miniature: a one-line definition of done relocates ambiguity to the line itself and invites minimal-compliance performance, so post-agreement dispute is pushed rather than eliminated.","grounds":"General background on specification and checklist dynamics; the task phrase about disagreeing over what an agreement meant is consistent with standards diverging at execution time, not only content being underspecified at agreement time.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c1"]},{"id":"ob1","type":"objection","target":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c1","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2"],"text":"The account over-promises where it says explicitness shrinks the dispute surface without any fairness negotiation at all: a written and comparable allocation is more available to fairness contestation, not less, and ambiguity moves onto the definition-of-done line where it can be gamed by minimal compliance.","bearing":"The consequence stated for cm2 is overstated; the system should be proposed with an expectation of recurring meta-disputes at the done-line and a cheap revision channel, which the two-week revision date only partially supplies. The bite is limited: the account says most of the dispute surface, and most may survive even if all does not.","depends":["n1"]},{"id":"n2","type":"claim","text":"In the proposed design the binding input is each person's self-reported weekly availability; claims are keyed to it, and neither the account nor its commitments contain any mechanism to detect or correct systematic under-reporting or under-claiming.","grounds":"Inspection of the action described in cm2; the account's own p1 lists quiet under-contribution as a live possibility.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p1"]},{"id":"ob2","type":"objection","target":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm3"],"text":"The no-blame miss rule combined with availability-keyed claiming is exploitable by any flatmate, not only the avoidant one; the account's own objection locates gaming in the avoider's re-entry, whereas the allocation mechanism itself runs on unverifiable self-report and has no fairness floor.","bearing":"If the quietly-doing-less reading in p1 is operative, the trial ratifies it as legitimate availability; some open periodic review of claimed and completed totals is missing from the design.","depends":["n2"],"mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#o1","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p1"]},{"id":"ob3","type":"objection","target":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm4"],"text":"Unresolved tension: cm2 creates a complete, visible, written record of claims and misses while cm4 bans score-keeping; a shared visible ledger is exactly the instrument that makes score-keeping possible, and the account never states what the record may legitimately be used for.","bearing":"A charitable reading — cm4 bans only silent private tallies — narrows the tension but leaves a residue: cm4 gives no trigger for when deliberately absorbed unevenness becomes a fairness issue to raise, so the line between tolerance and drift is undrawn. The repair is to state the distinction explicitly: no private tallies, totals contested only openly against the shared record."},{"id":"ob4","type":"objection","target":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm1"],"text":"The process-first one-to-one rests on c3, which the account itself labels low-confidence; the remedial conversation is itself an instance of the avoided genre — a talk about the chore talks — so it may be declined for the same reason the originals were, and it risks casting the friend as the case-to-be-explained before any of their evidence is in, which can confirm the impulse to avoid.","bearing":"If c3 is wrong, as p1's alternatives permit, cm1 misfires or merely delays, and no fallback is offered. An unconsidered alternative is format-first: make the group process shorter, asynchronous and provisional, let the new format re-invite the avoider, and reserve the one-to-one. The account's low-stakes framing partially mitigates this but does not answer the fallback question, and the priority of cm1 is asserted rather than argued against alternatives.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c3","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p1"]},{"id":"ob5","type":"objection","target":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm1","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2"],"text":"Bootstrap and authority gap: the trial, the no-blame rule and the revision date must all be agreed at a conversation of exactly the kind one flatmate now avoids, so the whole programme has a single point of failure at cm1; and the user is a peer who can propose but not convene, yet the plan assigns them the designer role and never enlists the non-avoidant third flatmate.","bearing":"If the one-to-one is itself avoided or fails, the account contains no next move; a minimal fix is to make cm2's elements proposable individually and asynchronously — a shared list can be started by one person and joined — rather than as a package requiring a founding meeting."},{"id":"u1","type":"use","text":"Adopt the trial's visible record explicitly as the fairness instrument: it is the natural evidence for resolving the account's open problem p2, and using it openly for that purpose implements the injunction to raise fairness openly against shared data rather than private ledgers — which also dissolves most of ob3's tension.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm4","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p2"]},{"id":"pr1","type":"problem","text":"Undiscriminated cause: do this flat's disputes arise at agreement time, from underspecified content, or at execution time, from divergent standards for what counts as done? The account's remedy touches both but with different emphases — writing versus calibration — and no discriminating observation is proposed.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c1","n1"]},{"id":"pr2","type":"problem","text":"What event should flip deliberately absorbing unevenness into raising fairness openly — a duration, a ratio, a felt sense? Without a trigger, tolerance has no terminus and can drift into a stable unfair equilibrium.","mentions":["h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm4","ob3"]}],"uptake":["n1","n2","ob1","ob2","ob3","ob4","ob5","u1","pr1","pr2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c1","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#c2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#cm3","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p1","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#p2","h005.fork5.p.objection.0#o1"]}